# device_lifecycle_pause_quirks: Without a guest display nothing asserts: pause twice, then unpause once, runs the next NOP; unpause while running starts the FIFO again and raises an interrupt. Pause and unpause with no root page or FIFO at all raise only unpause's interrupt.
